keel-overlay-wireguard (0.1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The manifest's screen is the Overlay network entry of confconsole's
    Instance menu, /usr/lib/confconsole/plugins.d/Instance/Overlay_network.py.
    It named /usr/lib/confconsole/plugins.d/Networking/wireguard.py, a file
    that no confconsole installs (found by decision 0098).
    tests/overlay-install.bats checks that confconsole installs the file
    the manifest names.

